&lt;p&gt;What if URL search parameters in Next.js were as simple as useState — with type safety and serialization built in?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://nuqs.47ng.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;nuqs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is a type-safe search params state manager for Next.js.&lt;br&gt;
